{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 16121112230550340097,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Chain exceptions at C level",
      "source_hash": 7547194252636132767,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "C 수준에서 예외 연결",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122693Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 4422181755069454546,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122696Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Chain exceptions at C level, as already done at Python level.",
      "source_hash": 15610577112259545875,
      "context_hash": 10356062162691928027,
      "translation": "Python 수준에서 이미 수행되는 것처럼 C 수준에서도 예외를 연결합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122696Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rationale",
      "source_hash": 18339363210720796208,
      "context_hash": 14203670706398664937,
      "translation": "근거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122696Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 3 introduced a new killer feature: exceptions are chained by default, :pep:`3134`.",
      "source_hash": 15214614328885686829,
      "context_hash": 8025880593338732603,
      "translation": "Python 3에서는 새로운 획기적인 기능을 도입했습니다. 예외가 기본적으로 연결됩니다. :pep:`3134`.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122697Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 1593042996045129432,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122697Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Output",
      "source_hash": 18158795255602651411,
      "context_hash": 10299755171287228419,
      "translation": "출력",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122697Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Exceptions are chained by default in Python code, but not in extensions written in C.",
      "source_hash": 7546996637234717033,
      "context_hash": 16672528525263447007,
      "translation": "Python 코드에서는 예외가 기본적으로 연결되지만, C로 작성된 확장 기능에서는 연결되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122697Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "A new private ``_PyErr_ChainExceptions()`` function was introduced in Python 3.4.3 and 3.5 to chain exceptions.",
      "source_hash": 13988376274752058555,
      "context_hash": 2584318018297024698,
      "translation": "예외를 연결하기 위한 새로운 비공개 ``_PyErr_ChainExceptions()`` 함수가 Python 3.4.3 및 3.5에 도입되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122697Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Currently, it must be called explicitly to chain exceptions and its usage is not trivial.",
      "source_hash": 15708832676897308111,
      "context_hash": 8245793237562806365,
      "translation": "현재는 예외를 연결하려면 이 함수를 명시적으로 호출해야 하며, 사용법도 간단하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122698Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Example of ``_PyErr_ChainExceptions()`` usage from the ``zipimport`` module to chain the previous ``OSError`` to a new ``ZipImportError`` exception",
      "source_hash": 1746709757159365837,
      "context_hash": 14392975070401753421,
      "translation": "이전 ``OSError``\\ 를 새로운 ``ZipImportError`` 예외에 연결하기 위해 ``zipimport`` 모듈에서 ``_PyErr_ChainExceptions()``\\ 를 사용하는 예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122698Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP proposes to also chain exceptions automatically at C level to stay consistent and give more information on failures to help debugging.",
      "source_hash": 6052782899758956612,
      "context_hash": 5653030531547519442,
      "translation": "이 PEP에서는 일관성을 유지하고 실패에 관한 더 많은 정보를 제공하여 디버깅에 도움을 주도록 C 수준에서도 예외를 자동으로 연결할 것을 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122698Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "The previous example becomes simply",
      "source_hash": 14054335433916751490,
      "context_hash": 1989721103720001475,
      "translation": "앞의 예제는 단순해집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122699Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Proposal",
      "source_hash": 17139217736364358932,
      "context_hash": 1653860881819117947,
      "translation": "제안",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122699Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Modify PyErr_*() functions to chain exceptions",
      "source_hash": 6307527914241582089,
      "context_hash": 6770127977509087053,
      "translation": "예외를 연결하도록 PyErr_*() 함수 수정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122699Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Modify C functions raising exceptions of the Python C API to automatically chain exceptions: modify ``PyErr_SetString()``, ``PyErr_Format()``, ``PyErr_SetNone()``, etc.",
      "source_hash": 643122290804441473,
      "context_hash": 13229849421552645712,
      "translation": "예외를 발생시키는 Python C API의 C 함수를 수정하여 예외를 자동으로 연결합니다. ``PyErr_SetString()``, ``PyErr_Format()``, ``PyErr_SetNone()`` 등을 수정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122700Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Modify functions to not chain exceptions",
      "source_hash": 597819667864164769,
      "context_hash": 9986501968610910224,
      "translation": "예외를 연결하지 않도록 함수 수정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122700Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Keeping the previous exception is not always interesting when the new exception contains information of the previous exception or even more information, especially when the two exceptions have the same type.",
      "source_hash": 9130970615268528199,
      "context_hash": 18111012273036787380,
      "translation": "새 예외에 이전 예외의 정보 또는 그보다 더 많은 정보가 포함되어 있는 경우, 특히 두 예외의 유형이 같은 경우에는 이전 예외를 유지하는 것이 항상 유용하지는 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122700Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example of an useless exception chain with ``int(str)``",
      "source_hash": 14488544749008437130,
      "context_hash": 11459462515891566759,
      "translation": "``int(str)``\\ 를 사용한 쓸모없는 예외 연결 예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122700Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The new ``TypeError`` exception contains more information than the previous exception.",
      "source_hash": 2969227593407591887,
      "context_hash": 10636923317122453789,
      "translation": "새로운 ``TypeError`` 예외에는 이전 예외보다 더 많은 정보가 포함되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122700Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "The previous exception should be hidden.",
      "source_hash": 10412385648132045364,
      "context_hash": 9358705828341177737,
      "translation": "이전 예외는 숨겨야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122701Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The ``PyErr_Clear()`` function can be called to clear the current exception before raising a new exception, to not chain the current exception with a new exception.",
      "source_hash": 12303266928513208957,
      "context_hash": 4321686298128161804,
      "translation": "새 예외를 발생시키기 전에 현재 예외를 지우도록 ``PyErr_Clear()`` 함수\\ 를 호출하여 현재 예외가 새 예외와 연결되지 않도록 할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122701Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Modify functions to chain exceptions",
      "source_hash": 1300121282620722934,
      "context_hash": 10155923414322484954,
      "translation": "예외를 연결하도록 함수 수정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122701Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Some functions save and then restore the current exception.",
      "source_hash": 2159107840225390447,
      "context_hash": 726850698195260250,
      "translation": "일부 함수는 현재 예외를 저장한 다음 복원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122701Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If a new exception is raised, the exception is currently displayed into sys.stderr or ignored depending on the function.",
      "source_hash": 11186168656135820448,
      "context_hash": 3111415050837307004,
      "translation": "새 예외가 발생하면 함수에 따라 해당 예외가 현재 sys.stderr에 표시되거나 무시됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122702Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Some of these functions should be modified to chain exceptions instead.",
      "source_hash": 17968971786560544475,
      "context_hash": 8936974223725810418,
      "translation": "이러한 함수 중 일부는 대신 예외를 연결하도록 수정해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122702Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples of function ignoring the new exception(s):",
      "source_hash": 15120302630391875125,
      "context_hash": 2052581030557616074,
      "translation": "새 예외를 무시하는 함수의 예:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122702Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "``ptrace_enter_call()``: ignore exception",
      "source_hash": 11854609388702452087,
      "context_hash": 2357311709129122873,
      "translation": "``ptrace_enter_call()``: 예외 무시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122702Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "``subprocess_fork_exec()``: ignore exception raised by enable_gc()",
      "source_hash": 17891923705182196324,
      "context_hash": 12616065632641797515,
      "translation": "``subprocess_fork_exec()``: enable_gc()에서 발생한 예외 무시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122702Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "``t_bootstrap()`` of the ``_thread`` module: ignore exception raised by trying to display the bootstrap function to ``sys.stderr``",
      "source_hash": 15102172206491479228,
      "context_hash": 6559332229942695359,
      "translation": "``_thread`` 모듈의 ``t_bootstrap()``: 부트스트랩 함수를 ``sys.stderr``\\ 에 표시하려고 시도하는 과정에서 발생한 예외를 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:47:42.375338Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "``PyDict_GetItem()``, ``_PyDict_GetItem_KnownHash()``: ignore exception raised by looking for a key in the dictionary",
      "source_hash": 2988212454753330254,
      "context_hash": 3708511818644923595,
      "translation": "``PyDict_GetItem()``, ``_PyDict_GetItem_KnownHash()``: 딕셔너리에서 키를 찾다가 발생한 예외 무시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dictionary": "딕셔너리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122703Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "``_PyErr_TrySetFromCause()``: ignore exception",
      "source_hash": 7648972078017870170,
      "context_hash": 3206219582066575259,
      "translation": "``_PyErr_TrySetFromCause()``: 예외 무시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:27.122704Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "``PyFrame_LocalsToFast()``: ignore exception raised by ``dict_to_map()``",
      "source_hash": 2638036727235257980,
      "context_hash": 9460760651403622126,
      "translation": "``PyFrame_LocalsToFast()``: ``dict_to_map()``\\ 에서 발생한 예외를 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "``_PyObject_Dump()``: ignore exception. ``_PyObject_Dump()`` is used to debug, to inspect a running process, it should not modify the Python state.",
      "source_hash": 5980585946460225950,
      "context_hash": 8968750703458382302,
      "translation": "``_PyObject_Dump()``\\ : 예외를 무시합니다. ``_PyObject_Dump()``\\ 은 디버깅하고 실행 중인 프로세스를 검사하는 데 사용되므로 Python 상태를 수정해서는 안 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901560Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "``Py_ReprLeave()``: ignore exception \"because there is no way to report them\"",
      "source_hash": 9745080152269613758,
      "context_hash": 14493435765597609624,
      "translation": "``Py_ReprLeave()``\\ : 예외를 무시합니다. “예외를 보고할 방법이 없기 때문입니다.”",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901560Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "``type_dealloc()``: ignore exception raised by ``remove_all_subclasses()``",
      "source_hash": 3383150708577430948,
      "context_hash": 2381371762839310953,
      "translation": "``type_dealloc()``\\ : ``remove_all_subclasses()``\\ 에서 발생한 예외를 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901560Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "``PyObject_ClearWeakRefs()``: ignore exception?",
      "source_hash": 9062585343537350529,
      "context_hash": 6873245064838063802,
      "translation": "``PyObject_ClearWeakRefs()``\\ : 예외를 무시합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901561Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "``call_exc_trace()``, ``call_trace_protected()``: ignore exception",
      "source_hash": 2262840818853078031,
      "context_hash": 11260850917083072478,
      "translation": "``call_exc_trace()``, ``call_trace_protected()``\\ : 예외를 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901561Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "``remove_importlib_frames()``: ignore exception",
      "source_hash": 1641620390412520203,
      "context_hash": 10507101771822780370,
      "translation": "``remove_importlib_frames()``\\ : 예외를 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901561Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "``do_mktuple()``, helper used by ``Py_BuildValue()`` for example: ignore exception?",
      "source_hash": 3958106134549240491,
      "context_hash": 2733579020802482759,
      "translation": "``do_mktuple()``, 예를 들어 ``Py_BuildValue()``\\ 에서 사용되는 도우미: 예외를 무시합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901562Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "``flush_io()``: ignore exception",
      "source_hash": 6093706758794908881,
      "context_hash": 15360350700384967442,
      "translation": "``flush_io()``\\ : 예외를 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901562Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "``sys_write()``, ``sys_format()``: ignore exception",
      "source_hash": 10224203761219096022,
      "context_hash": 7511871985613626864,
      "translation": "``sys_write()``, ``sys_format()``\\ : 예외를 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901562Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "``_PyTraceback_Add()``: ignore exception",
      "source_hash": 10582455500333426827,
      "context_hash": 4566558865841266422,
      "translation": "``_PyTraceback_Add()``\\ : 예외를 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901563Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "``PyTraceBack_Print()``: ignore exception",
      "source_hash": 2358661358851116143,
