      "translation": "변경하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901570Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A new private ``_PyErr_ChainExceptions()`` function is enough to chain manually exceptions.",
      "source_hash": 10287099650833060991,
      "context_hash": 14794027154061561041,
      "translation": "새로운 비공개 ``_PyErr_ChainExceptions()``\\ 함수로 예외를 수동으로 연결하기에 충분합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901570Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Exceptions will only be chained explicitly where it makes sense.",
      "source_hash": 10825182724872048364,
      "context_hash": 3478671635435781068,
      "translation": "타당한 경우에만 예외를 명시적으로 연결합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:03:37.901571Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "New helpers to chain exceptions",
      "source_hash": 2230540488067168667,
      "context_hash": 5087942216481078191,
      "translation": "예외를 연결하기 위한 새로운 헬퍼",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:58:52.583934Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Functions like ``PyErr_SetString()`` don't chain automatically exceptions.",
      "source_hash": 13767900653681590789,
      "context_hash": 12377382122904561437,
      "translation": "``PyErr_SetString()``\\ 과 같은 함수는 예외를 자동으로 연결하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:58:52.583938Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "To make the usage of ``_PyErr_ChainExceptions()`` easier, new private functions are added:",
      "source_hash": 8223004476727937441,
      "context_hash": 12550277035854331950,
      "translation": "``_PyErr_ChainExceptions()``\\ 의 사용을 쉽게 하기 위해 새로운 비공개 함수가 추가되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:58:52.583939Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:2/seg:0",
